WEBVTT

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:51.440
Will this really work, Lanhua?

00:01:51.950 --> 00:01:52.980
Of course.

00:01:53.490 --> 00:01:55.550
Mikeru-sama gave me this chance of a lifetime.

00:01:55.910 --> 00:01:57.420
I'm not going to waste it!

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:10.480
I'm going to capture the Mermaid Princesses alive and deliver them to Mikeru-sama.

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:14.970
This time, you'd better not let us down.

00:02:15.050 --> 00:02:17.600
I'll go inform Mikeru-sama.

00:02:18.140 --> 00:02:18.830
All right.

00:02:20.970 --> 00:02:22.380
Seira's Garden

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:29.750
Yay! We have no school today!

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:33.890
Even though this is a cultural tour, everyone's treating it like a trip.

00:02:33.990 --> 00:02:35.770
Bringing snacks is allowed!

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:38.050
Goodness, Kaito.

00:02:38.790 --> 00:02:40.950
Hey, why don't we sit next to each other?

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:44.070
The lunch box I made for you is full of things you like to eat{, Kaito}.

00:02:45.780 --> 00:02:50.240
Okay! To prevent fighting over where to sit, we'll be drawing lots!

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:54.610
Hey, Lucia. Can I have some chocolate?

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:55.450
Sure!

00:02:56.470 --> 00:03:00.120
It appears that my seat has been taken over by snacks.

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:03.850
Eh!? Kaito is in the seat next to mine?

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:06.910
Okay! Everyone please take your seats!

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:11.220
Everyone will need to cooperate with their neighbors all day today.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:13.470
Please get along and don't fight!

00:03:13.550 --> 00:03:15.230
Yes, ma'am!

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:16.740
What a wonderful coincidence.

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:19.640
I'm going to be with Kaito all day!

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:23.650
I'm happy for you, Lucia.

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:28.420
Kaito and Lucia-chan are sitting next to each other.

00:03:31.180 --> 00:03:35.900
Even though I was beaten during the last fight, I learned that I can use karaoke to lure the Mermaid Princesses.

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:37.760
Speaking of karaoke...

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:45.370
A bus guide!

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:51.340
But in order for me to use karaoke and put in the Mermaid Princesses' songs,

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:56.650
I had to go to buses left and right, and I ended up getting no leads at all and instead tiring myself out.

00:04:01.580 --> 00:04:05.300
However, the success of this battle plan is about to appear!

00:04:05.380 --> 00:04:09.330
It's only a matter of time before those mermaids fall into this trap I created!

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:12.910
Hello, everyone!

00:04:13.090 --> 00:04:18.210
{Today, I will be serving everyone.}I'll be serving all of you today. I am the new bus guide, Lanlan.

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:21.860
I'm looking forward to getting along with everyone today!

00:04:34.780 --> 00:04:35.590
Kaito...

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:42.920
Why is Kaito so happy talking with Lucia?

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:47.030
Okay, everyone! Pay attention!

00:04:47.230 --> 00:04:49.960
I'm {about to distribute}going to hand out maps of the arboretum.

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:53.820
Please inform me of where you plan on going in the arboretum.

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:57.620
Hey, Kaito. Where should we go?

00:04:57.720 --> 00:05:00.320
Anywhere is fine. I'll leave it up to you.

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:02.770
You're pushing it off onto other people.

00:05:03.180 --> 00:05:05.910
If we don't decide where to go, we'll get scolded by the teacher.

00:05:08.110 --> 00:05:09.330
A hibiscus...

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:16.200
Last year, Kaito drew that flower on the surfboard that I got for my birthday.

00:05:16.940 --> 00:05:18.900
The surfboard got burned, though.

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:23.800
Kaito gave me this keychain that has a hibiscus on it as a replacement.

00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:32.710
Ah, a surfboard keychain.

00:05:33.070 --> 00:05:35.390
What's the name of the flower on it?

00:05:35.490 --> 00:05:38.660
Huh? Uhh... it's called a hibiscus.

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:41.590
Oh, it's called a hibiscus, huh?

00:05:43.050 --> 00:05:45.500
Hey, Lucia. Why don't we take a look at those flowers?

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:48.070
Eh? You want to look at hibiscuses?

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:52.230
What? Is it wrong for me to suggest hibiscuses?

00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:54.380
Oh no! That's not it.

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:57.210
All right, then. Let's go check out the tropical plants.

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:04.050
Something embarrassing!

00:06:04.100 --> 00:06:05.840
Something embarrassing!

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:09.770
We've got friends over, and Father comes out of the bathroom without a stitch of clothing!

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:11.350
Something embarrassing!

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:12.960
Something embarrassing!

00:06:13.190 --> 00:06:17.270
I selected the wrong number on the karaoke machine, and out came enka music!

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:20.460
Rina and the bus guide are hilarious!

00:06:20.590 --> 00:06:23.420
The two of them make such a funny two-person comedy act!

00:06:23.470 --> 00:06:28.120
Okay, next up is {the story of}"Together with Little Pig and Little Hopper{ living together}."

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:29.650
Let's do karaoke next!

00:06:29.770 --> 00:06:31.510
Eh? I see.

00:06:31.610 --> 00:06:34.160
And the three of us finally got to be together.

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:34.800
Oink. Oink.

00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:36.330
Ahh!

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:40.290
W-Why is the karaoke machine broken!?

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:43.250
Sorry about that. It's been broken for a while.

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:46.590
Ahh! Why!? I can't believe this!

00:06:47.100 --> 00:06:48.150
Sparkle!

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:52.670
Next up is "Together with Little Pig and Little Hopper!"

00:06:52.790 --> 00:06:53.940
...the student story.

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:55.470
I'm back!

00:06:55.550 --> 00:06:56.190
Welcome back.

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:58.330
How was it, seeing our classmates for the first time in five years?

00:06:58.380 --> 00:06:59.660
Oh, we're already here.

00:07:00.910 --> 00:07:03.410
I see. So this is a botanical garden.

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:05.270
It's pretty large.

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:06.680
It really is.

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:08.410
Kaito.

00:07:12.930 --> 00:07:13.750
Mikaru?

00:07:14.180 --> 00:07:15.890
What are you doing?

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:21.450
I just feel a bit weak, and I feel better when I'm with you.

00:07:22.020 --> 00:07:24.800
Please stay with me, Kaito.

00:07:25.690 --> 00:07:26.580
Mikaru...

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:29.370
I've already told the teacher.

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:36.000
You know about what's happening to my body better than anyone, so it'll put me at ease.

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:37.350
Please, Kaito.

00:07:41.970 --> 00:07:43.220
I'm sorry, Mikaru.

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:47.430
I already promised Lucia to go to the tropical section of the botanical garden.

00:07:48.790 --> 00:07:49.550
Kaito...

00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:55.630
Let's go, Lucia.

00:07:56.420 --> 00:07:57.340
Kaito!

00:07:57.870 --> 00:07:58.640
Kaito...

00:08:00.300 --> 00:08:02.700
No way,{How could that be?} how could it be?

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:17.060
Kaito, the hibiscus area seems to be in the neighboring greenhouse.

00:08:17.170 --> 00:08:18.190
Is that so?

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:19.390
Hey, Kaito!

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:19.850
Hmm?

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:22.530
Weren't you with Mikaru-chan?

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:25.380
Kengo, wasn't Mikaru with you?

00:08:25.590 --> 00:08:29.030
{That's because}But Mikaru-chan wanted to be with you.

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:33.530
Ah, Kaito!

00:08:35.770 --> 00:08:36.660
Kaito.

00:08:49.680 --> 00:08:50.960
What's wrong, Lucia?

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:52.740
Why are you here alone?

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:54.710
Weren't you with Kaito-kun?

00:08:54.810 --> 00:08:56.900
Well, some stuff happened...

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:04.610
If I'd be able to forget Kaito, then I wouldn't feel this horrible.

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:09.690
Huh? What's going on?

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:11.760
Seira's compact is glowing!

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:14.610
Oh no! This is a bad place for this to happen, Lucia!

00:09:15.920 --> 00:09:21.150
Because the karaoke machine is busted, staying here isn't going to do me any good.

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:23.670
I should just hurry back and plan the next battle.

00:09:26.760 --> 00:09:30.230
{Could...that be}Is that... the light of the Mermaid Princesses?

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:41.440
Lucia, what is this feeling that sometimes flows into my heart?

00:09:41.770 --> 00:09:45.090
Even though it's a feeling of love, it makes my heart ache and suffer.

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:47.150
This is what I'm feeling.

00:09:47.460 --> 00:09:51.240
It's like it's going to overflow, and it won't stop.

00:09:51.670 --> 00:09:54.070
What is this, Lucia?

00:09:54.220 --> 00:09:55.120
Seira...

00:09:55.350 --> 00:09:56.670
What's she saying?

00:09:56.720 --> 00:09:57.460
I don't know.

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:04.350
You've finally appeared, Mermaid Princesses!

00:10:09.870 --> 00:10:10.910
They've escaped!

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:12.090
If that's the case...

00:10:13.820 --> 00:10:15.790
It's all because of the Mermaid Princesses!

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:17.500
They've wasted our time and energy.

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:19.080
We've wasted strength!

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:22.830
However, the Mermaid Princesses must be nearby.

00:10:22.910 --> 00:10:24.540
We're going to beat them up this time!

00:10:24.590 --> 00:10:25.890
Okay!

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:30.900
Dance!

00:10:34.140 --> 00:10:35.160
Let's go!

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:40.700
That music is...

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:41.610
...Lanhua!

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:43.090
Let's go, Lucia, Hanon!

00:10:49.470 --> 00:10:51.110
Pink Pearl Voice!

00:10:55.110 --> 00:10:56.880
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:01.520
Green Pearl Voice!

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:05.940
It's unforgivable to force guests at the arboretum to dance until it hurts!

00:11:06.340 --> 00:11:07.820
I won't forgive you!

00:11:07.880 --> 00:11:08.720
That's rude!

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:11.630
You've finally shown up, Mermaid Princesses!

00:11:11.910 --> 00:11:13.460
This time, you're going to get it!

00:11:59.220 --> 00:12:00.810
Okay, now!

00:12:13.740 --> 00:12:14.360
A cage!

00:12:38.750 --> 00:12:40.980
We caught the mermaids!

00:12:41.260 --> 00:12:43.350
Now, forget everything!

00:12:43.730 --> 00:12:45.340
Dance until it hurts!

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:49.930
Forget everything and dance until it hurts?

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:52.180
Does that mean that I'm going to forget about Kaito?

00:12:52.490 --> 00:12:53.790
I don't want that!

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:58.200
No matter how painful {and lonely }it gets, {I'm never going to}I'll never forget Kaito!

00:12:58.280 --> 00:12:59.530
No!

00:13:02.520 --> 00:13:04.950
Presented by Licca and Wasurenai-Fansubs

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:17.190
Ah! You finally caught the Mermaid Princesses?

00:13:17.210 --> 00:13:19.050
Great job, Lanhua!

00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:22.170
This is what we can do!

00:13:22.270 --> 00:13:23.260
This is the proof!

00:13:23.370 --> 00:13:25.660
Now, let's get the Mermaid Princesses...

00:13:25.690 --> 00:13:27.400
...back to Mikeru-sama.

00:13:27.420 --> 00:13:31.510
No! The power of our love can't be defeated by something like this!

00:13:31.710 --> 00:13:38.190
Hehe! How do you plan to escape from a cage made from Mikeru-sama's power?

00:13:38.350 --> 00:13:41.740
We're going to use our song to destroy this cage!

00:13:41.870 --> 00:13:43.170
Let's go, Hanon!

00:13:43.250 --> 00:13:43.880
Yeah!

00:13:44.060 --> 00:13:44.730
Rina!

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:45.340
Okay!

00:14:36.410 --> 00:14:39.080
Pichi Pichi Voice Live Start!

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:17.720
Ahh!

00:15:17.980 --> 00:15:19.710
It hurts!

00:15:20.400 --> 00:15:21.830
I hate this song!

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:28.550
No! No! No!

00:15:29.340 --> 00:15:30.200
This is annoying!

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:31.150
Stop it!

00:15:37.530 --> 00:15:40.210
Love Shower Pitch!

00:15:43.930 --> 00:15:45.340
How about an encore?

00:15:45.470 --> 00:15:51.560
I won't accept this! If I weren't tired out from being a bus guide, I wouldn't have lost to you!

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:53.430
Remember that!

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:12.670
Lanhua was absolutely useless.

00:16:17.320 --> 00:16:20.120
Is that... Mikeru-sama?

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:42.380
No way. That's...

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:44.550
...Mikeru's voice.

00:17:44.650 --> 00:17:47.510
Why does it sound so sad?

00:18:00.780 --> 00:18:05.120
Lucia, that feeling just now... it was of loving someone, but it made my heart ache.

00:18:05.290 --> 00:18:06.540
My heart feels like I'm suffering.

00:18:07.820 --> 00:18:09.860
What in the world is this feeling?

00:18:11.210 --> 00:18:13.820
I'm sorry for making you uncomfortable, Seira.

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:16.980
At that time, I was feeling a bit depressed.

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:17.980
Lucia...

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:21.960
Depressed? That's what being depressed feels like?

00:18:22.090 --> 00:18:24.660
Yeah. But Seira, understand this:

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:30.790
No matter how much your heart aches or suffers, you can't give up the person you love.

00:18:30.940 --> 00:18:33.260
That's what it means to love someone.

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:36.200
That's... what it means to love someone?

00:18:36.610 --> 00:18:37.450
Lucia.

00:18:47.220 --> 00:18:48.270
Mikaru!

00:18:48.550 --> 00:18:51.050
Where are you, Mikaru?

00:18:56.210 --> 00:18:57.940
A hibiscus...

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:02.890
I think I gave this flower to someone before...

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:04.480
Who was it?

00:19:33.600 --> 00:19:36.860
It's a bit late, but it's your birthday present!{I'm sorry that I'm a bit late, but here's your birthday present. (This line must be checked with the previous season.)}

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:38.880
Thank you...

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:41.560
Thank you, Kaito!

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:58.480
Are you okay, Mikaru?

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:03.480
Kaito...

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:08.300
Let's go home, Mikaru.

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:12.900
I'll go hail a taxi. Let's go home together.

00:20:16.560 --> 00:20:19.470
Kaito said that Mikaru wasn't feeling well,

00:20:19.470 --> 00:20:20.680
so they went home early.

00:20:29.230 --> 00:20:30.560
A hibiscus?

00:20:33.800 --> 00:20:37.370
Why is it here? Could it be... from Kaito?

00:20:38.190 --> 00:20:39.540
But... why?

00:20:40.310 --> 00:20:42.040
Aren't you glad, Lucia?

00:23:52.060 --> 00:23:55.850
We're going to make sure to get you today, you cheeky Mermaid Princesses!

00:23:56.000 --> 00:24:00.540
When you arrive to try to rescue the trapped prince, first up will be Alala's hurdling song.

00:24:00.620 --> 00:24:02.610
Next up is the exquisite trap that Lanhua set up.

00:24:02.690 --> 00:24:05.010
After that, it's Lady Bat's scary attack.

00:24:05.140 --> 00:24:06.920
You're going to be so confused.

00:24:06.920 --> 00:24:09.480
And lastly, we'll deliver the finishing blow.

00:24:09.500 --> 00:24:12.870
Now, all of Mikeru-sama's servants, attack!

00:24:13.000 --> 00:24:15.930
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch Pure:

00:24:16.010 --> 00:24:17.690
The Melancholy of the Servants.

00:24:17.900 --> 00:24:19.610
How true!
